a limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name;\",\"start\":1921},{\"end\":2080,\"field\":\"action\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2067:2080:sha256-15c3b4b23ab68a348949d6647a14d58a9edbc35a66b03ff7a613cb2a1e40cf76\",\"quote\":\"may be issued\",\"start\":2067},{\"end\":2066,\"field\":\"object\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2039:2066:sha256-7c5242f452273d58b648473e49efef79268657cee618c30d4574f93e3a075b57\",\"quote\":\"a limited-validity passport\",\"start\":2039},{\"end\":2037,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1921:2037:sha256-69672abdd23b79c9ab53977f6c04fc575dfcf5ce9f86af983bd20b44baa19026\",\"quote\":\"If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel\",\"start\":1921},{\"end\":2070,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2067:2070:sha256-ee4d988c65de860fabbfbcd27f73d50bbebe3fba37fe419284f4811389c30bdc\",\"quote\":\"may\",\"start\":2067},{\"end\":1841,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1676:1841:sha256-8d6e9a2e653ca62614166aac8953994fa3ed5eaadb3fe7d2c0dd5978ab49c209\",\"quote\":\"If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change\",\"start\":1676},{\"end\":2037,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1921:2037:sha256-69672abdd23b79c9ab53977f6c04fc575dfcf5ce9f86af983bd20b44baa19026\",\"quote\":\"If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel\",\"start\":1921},{\"end\":2102,\"field\":\"concepts:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:2039:2102:sha256-0b91f837214eead6b57f4fbaf2eefecfdecf081e635075f3e6cacbda21bd23f3\",\"quote\":\"a limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name\",\"start\":2039},{\"end\":1774,\"field\":\"typed_values:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Aaa23cc4bc9758753066c6a970bc4e4d08f001f9fb228a7ab60b296a5ade86fdc:1724:1774:sha256-43e59de37518acf791cdec24febe5d82bfc02883339b2858f4a7b7b6f9f78b1f\",\"quote\":\"more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11\",\"start\":1724}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:5be1be35d35fc1d5c5472e1f21b27c5b56a5565ca27522470101c9b6bb5eec39\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f645fed23bac050d27b6eb23da1babb850a5e9b92ada283a2c876cd27da77c0a\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"may\",\"object\":\"a limited-validity passport in the requested name\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:505cb5c213452a5c669db7f82a8a38e58859a0ec3a642669818ab17a2e0dfd92\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel, a limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name;\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:301f777de449162988832acbc483a4d5a298f847f5f8034f88e0a0de4b6a1b23\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change\",\"If there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel\"],\"scope_text\":\"If the applicant has had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11 but has not updated her/his ID to reflect the material name change, and there is insufficient time to request that the applicant submit acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel.\",\"section_id\":\"fam-names-section-4\",\"start\":1921,\"summary\":\"When an applicant had a material name change more than one year prior to applying on Form DS-11 without updating their ID, and there is insufficient time to request submission of acceptable ID prior to urgent or emergency travel, a limited-validity passport may be issued in the requested name.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[{\"anchor\":\"applying on form DS-11\",\"comparator\":\"more than\",\"datatype\":\"xsd:duration\",\"name\":\"material name change timing threshold\",\"quote\":\"more than one year prior to applying on form DS-11\",\"unit\":\"year\",\"value\":\"P1Y\"}]}",
